canon subject status: review guard for verifying → shipped (spec_coverage.require_review, scope: verifying, shipped)
canon subject status:   ran unreviewed-promotion — every owned scenario needs a signed review, current with the spec and evidence it pinned, by an actor, and from a session, other than its evidence's
canon subject status:   ran open-blocker — 1 adopted change(s) checked for open blocker findings
canon subject status: unreviewed-promotion cart.add.01 — verifying → shipped: stale review by `reviewer-2`: its evidence changed (the latest evidence records are not the pinned ones) since the review; a pinned review counts only while what it saw is current — review it again (`canon review add`)
canon subject status: refused — record an independent review (`canon review add`) and close blocker findings, or pass --override-reason <text> to move anyway; the waiver is recorded on the subject and `canon gate check` keeps listing these gaps
